<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Confirmación de cita</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f5; color: #18181b; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 560px; margin: 32px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
    .header { background: #18181b; padding: 28px 32px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; }
    .header p { color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; }
    .body { padding: 32px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .card { background: #f4f4f5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .card-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7; }
    .card-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .card-label { font-size: 13px; color: #71717a; }
    .card-value { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; text-align: right; }
    .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .btn { flex: 1; display: inline-block; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; }
    .btn-primary { background: #18181b; color: #fff; }
    .btn-outline { border: 1.5px solid #e4e4e7; color: #18181b; background: #fff; }
    .note { font-size: 13px; color: #71717a; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #f4f4f5; text-align: center; }
    .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>{{businessName}}</h1>
      <p>Confirmación de cita</p>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <p class="greeting">Hola <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>, tu cita ha sido registrada correctamente.</p>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-row">
          <span class="card-label">Servicio</span>
          <span class="card-value">{{serviceName}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-row">
          <span class="card-label">Técnico</span>
          <span class="card-value">{{employeeName}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-row">
          <span class="card-label">Fecha</span>
          <span class="card-value">{{date}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-row">
          <span class="card-label">Hora</span>
          <span class="card-value">{{time}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-row">
          <span class="card-label">Duración</span>
          <span class="card-value">{{duration}} min</span>
        </div>
        {{#if price}}
        <div class="card-row">
          <span class="card-label">Precio</span>
          <span class="card-value">{{price}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/if}}
      </div>

      {{#if confirmUrl}}
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="{{confirmUrl}}" class="btn btn-primary">Confirmar cita</a>
        <a href="{{cancelUrl}}" class="btn btn-outline">Cancelar</a>
      </div>
      {{else}}
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="{{cancelUrl}}" class="btn btn-outline">Cancelar cita</a>
      </div>
      {{/if}}

      <p class="note">
        Si necesitas cambiar la cita, puedes llamarnos al <strong>{{businessPhone}}</strong> o responder a este email.<br><br>
        El enlace de cancelación estará disponible hasta 2 horas antes de la cita.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>Este email fue enviado por {{businessName}} a través de SaaS Citas.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
